## 1. Project overview

ExamFlow is a web-based examination management system designed to conduct online examinations with multiple question formats, automatic evaluation, coding assessments, and examination monitoring.

The platform has two main user roles:

- Admin: Creates examinations, manages subjects, enters questions, assigns students, configures examination settings, evaluates answers, and publishes results.
- Student: Logs in, attends assigned examinations, answers questions, writes and executes programs, and views published results.

The system should provide a professional, responsive, user-friendly interface that works on desktop computers, laptops, and tablets.

