## 13. Timer and automatic submission

The examination timer must be controlled by the server, not just by the student's browser.

Example:

Python Programming Examination

Illustrative examination timer

# 01:24:35

Total duration: 120 minutes

In progress

### Timer rules

- Duration is configured by the admin.
- The timer starts when the student begins their examination during the permitted schedule.
- All assigned students share the same scheduled examination deadline.
- Late students receive only the remaining time.
- Refreshing cannot reset the timer.
- Closing the browser cannot stop the server-side deadline.
- When time expires, the system automatically locks and submits the attempt.

